  "description": "Radia's quest for revenge against her treacherous friend takes an unexpected turn when she is saved from a near-death experience by Yulius, a mysteriously powerful man. The twist? Yulius is a ghost, visible only to Radia. As he becomes Radia's constant companion, Radia is embroiled in a web of supernatural mishaps that reveal just how potent Yulius really is. And although even Yulius doesn't know his true identity yet, his near-omnipotence might be the key to Radia exacting her revenge. However, this power might also conceal a lurking danger that threatens to reshape their quest in unexpected and perilous ways...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000061267), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/radia), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/radia), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3372014037), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11122583), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/64077597), [Toptoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/Radia?p_id=pp_1601_001), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/episode/9793)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/radia), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/163410)",
